{"unit_id":"libinghui55__dsh-tavily-search#feature-1","repo":"libinghui55/dsh-tavily-search","commit":"2376a15887977fc6d34a929337a7ecb8a3dcab67","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-tavily-search 的功能「Tavily 网页搜索」：把 DSH 搜索请求发送到 Tavily，并将答案与带标题、摘要和链接的结果映射回 DSH。通过 web 搜索提供方调用，输入查询词并产出搜索结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:86-134"]}
